SUMMARY:Hurt Hub 101
DESCRIPTION:What is the Hurt Hub\, exactly? Great question. Come find out! \nHurt Hub 101 is a free\, no-pressure monthly info session for anyone who’s curious about what we do\, what our space looks like\, and how we support the community. \nOctober 21st from 11:15am-11:45am \nAfter the session\, attendees are welcome to stay for additional conversation by attending our Innovation Community of Practice from 12-1p.
