SUMMARY:Solopreneur Circle
DESCRIPTION:A monthly community gathering for entrepreneurs to celebrate wins\, work through challenges\, and discover resources.\n\n\nEach month we welcome entrepreneurs to join us at the Hurt Hub for a community gathering called the Solopreneur Circle. \nFacilitated by Michelle McKown-Campbell\, this intimate space brings together solo entrepreneurs to celebrate wins\, work through challenges\, and discover resources with people who are on similar paths. \nCoffee\, community\, and conversations that matter. Your seat at the table is waiting. \n  \nThe Hurt Hub welcomes requests for reasonable accommodations related to disability and will strive to make this program accessible to participants. Please contact our team at the Hurt Hub at contact@example.edu to make such a request.
URL:https://hurthub.davidson.edu/event/solopreneur-circle-3/
LOCATION:The Hurt Hub at Davidson College\, 210 Delburg Street\, Davidson\, NC 28036\, Davidson\, NC\, 28036\, US
